OL,3,ABystander 'heroically intervened' after
OL,4,Athree children and teacher killed in US
OL,5,Aschool shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FOregon Governor Tina Kotek has praised
OL,8,Fa bystander who "heroically intervened"
OL,9,Fto stop a shooting at a primary school
OL,11,FFour people, including a teacher and
OL,12,Fchildren aged five, eight and 11, were
OL,13,Fkilled in a shooting at Silver Rail
OL,14,FElementary School in Bend on Thursday -
OL,15,Fhere's what we know, and don't know, so
OL,16,Ffar
OL,18,FThe suspected attacker has been
OL,19,Fidentified as 16-year-old John Griffin
OL,20,Faccording to reporting by the BBC's US
OL,21,Fpartner CBS News
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
