OL,3,ABystander 'heroically intervened' after
OL,4,Athree children and teacher killed in US
OL,5,Aschool shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FGriffin was shot dead by a community
OL,8,Fmember who "pursued him into the
OL,9,Fschool", Bend Police Chief Mike Krantz
OL,10,Fsays
OL,12,FSchools in the district will remain
OL,13,Fclosed today "due to the tragedy",
OL,14,Fofficials say
OL,16,FOregon's gun law strength is ranked
OL,17,F12th out of 50 states, according to
OL,18,Fadvocacy group Everytown for Gun Safety
OL,19,F- how strict are the state's gun laws?
